// The Sengoku period, province by province. Written for this app from the standard histories; territory is the
// dominant power in each of the 68 old provinces, an approximation (many provinces were shared among small lords).
// Holder: a clan id, [a, b] for a province split between two powers (null in the pair = local lords), or null when
// no single power held it.

